sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Analyst
  participant S as Web UI
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant J as Job runner
  participant M as ml_engine
  participant D as Database
  U->>S: Upload CSV
  S->>A: POST /datasets (multipart, JWT)
  A->>A: validate type, size, content
  A->>D: create dataset (status processing) and job
  A-->>S: 202 dataset, job
  A->>J: submit ingest job
  J->>M: parse, aggregate hourly, quality score
  J->>D: store readings, mark dataset ready
  loop until terminal
    S->>A: GET /jobs/id
    A-->>S: status, progress
  end
  U->>S: Train
  S->>A: POST /datasets/id/train
  A->>J: submit train job
  J->>M: fit 24 horizon models on past data, evaluate on hold-out
  J->>D: save model version and metrics, activate
  U->>S: Forecast
  S->>A: POST /forecasts
  A->>M: features at origin, predict 24 h, add residual band
  A->>D: store forecast
  A-->>S: points with range
